@prefix pc: <https://example.invalid/nebula/ont/commercial-example/> .
@prefix d: <https://example.invalid/nebula/data/> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

<https://example.invalid/nebula/modules/pc-foundation> a owl:Ontology ; owl:versionIRI <https://example.invalid/nebula/modules/pc-foundation/1> .

pc:Party a owl:Class .
pc:Organization a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf pc:Party .
pc:Person a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf pc:Party .
pc:Account a owl:Class .
pc:OwnershipInterest a owl:Class .
pc:Location a owl:Class .
pc:Vehicle a owl:Class .
pc:RoleKind a owl:Class .
pc:RoleAssignment a owl:Class .
pc:accountOrganization a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:domain pc:Account ; rdfs:range pc:Organization .
pc:parentAccount a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:domain pc:Account ; rdfs:range pc:Account .
pc:owner a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:domain pc:OwnershipInterest ; rdfs:range pc:Party .
pc:ownedOrganization a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:domain pc:OwnershipInterest ; rdfs:range pc:Organization .
pc:ownershipPercent a owl:DatatypeProperty ; rdfs:domain pc:OwnershipInterest ; rdfs:range xsd:decimal .
pc:parentOrganization a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:domain pc:Organization ; rdfs:range pc:Organization .
pc:employedBy a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:domain pc:Person ; rdfs:range pc:Organization .
pc:operatesAt a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:domain pc:Organization ; rdfs:range pc:Location .
pc:roleParty a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:domain pc:RoleAssignment ; rdfs:range pc:Party .
pc:roleKind a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:domain pc:RoleAssignment ; rdfs:range pc:RoleKind .
pc:roleScope a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:domain pc:RoleAssignment .
pc:actsFor a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:domain pc:RoleAssignment ; rdfs:range pc:Organization .
